{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-hos-14-1","title":"Hosea 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to repentance. 4 A promise of God's blessing.</p>\n<p>return. 6:1; 12:6; 1Sa 7:3,4; 2Ch 30:6-9; Isa 55:6,7; Jer 3:12-14; 4:1 Joe 2:12,13; Zec 1:3,4; Ac 26:18-20 thou. 13:9; Jer 2:19; La 5:16; Eze 28:14-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-2","title":"Hosea 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>with. Job 34:31,32; Joe 2:17; Mt 6:9-13; Lu 11:2-4; 18:13 away. 2Sa 12:13; 24:10; Job 7:21; Ps 51:2-10; Isa 6:7; Eze 36:25,26 Mic 7:19; Zec 3:4; Joh 1:29; Ro 11:27; Tit 2:14; Heb 10:4 1Jo 1:7; 3:5 receive, etc. or, give good. Mt 7:11; Lu 11:13; 15:21-24; Eph 1:6,7; 2:7,8; 2Ti 1:9 the calves. Ps 69:30,31; Heb 13:15; 1Pe 2:5,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-3","title":"Hosea 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Asshur. 5:13; 7:11; 8:9; 12:1; 2Ch 16:7; Ps 146:3; Jer 31:18-22 we will not. De 17:16; Ps 20:7,8; 33:17; Isa 30:2,16; 31:3; 36:8 neither. 8; 2:17; Isa 1:29; 2:20; 27:9; Eze 36:25; 37:23; 43:7-9; Mic 5:10-14 Zec 13:2 for. Ex 22:22-24; Ps 10:14; 68:5; 146:9; Pr 23:10,11; Joh 14:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-4","title":"Hosea 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>heal. 11:7; Ex 15:26; Isa 57:18; Jer 3:22; 5:6; 8:22; 14:7; 17:14; 33:6 Mt 9:12,13 I will love. De 7:7,8; Zep 3:17; Ro 3:24; Eph 1:6; 2:4-9; 2Ti 1:9; Tit 3:4 for. Nu 25:4,11; Ps 78:38; Isa 12:1; 2Co 5:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-5","title":"Hosea 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>as the dew. De 32:2; 2Sa 23:4; Job 29:19; Ps 72:6; Pr 19:12; Isa 18:4; 26:19 Isa 44:3; Mic 5:7 he shall. So 2:1,2,16; 4:5; Mt 6:28; Lu 12:27 grow. or, blossom. cast. Heb. strike. 2Ki 19:30; Ps 72:16; Isa 27:6; 35:2; Eze 17:22-24; Eph 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-6","title":"Hosea 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>branches. Ps 80:9-11; Eze 17:5-8; 31:3-10; Da 4:10-15; Mt 13:31; Joh 15:1 Ro 11:16-24 spread. Heb. go. and his beauty. Ps 52:8; 128:3 his smell. Ge 27:27; So 4:11-15; 2Co 2:14,15; Php 4:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-7","title":"Hosea 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>that. Ps 91:1; So 2:3; Isa 32:1,2 revive. 6:2; Ps 85:6; 138:7; Isa 61:11; Joh 11:25; 12:24; 1Co 15:36-38 grow. or, blossom. 5; *marg: So 6:11; Zec 8:12 scent. or, memorial.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-8","title":"Hosea 14:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>What. 2,3; Job 34:32; Ac 19:18-20; 1Th 1:9; 1Pe 1:14-16; 4:3,4 I have. Job 33:27; Jer 31:18-20; Lu 15:20; Joh 1:47,48 I am. Isa 41:19; 55:13; 60:13 From me. Joh 1:16; 15:1-8; Ga 5:22,23; Eph 5:9; Php 1:11; 2:13; 4:13; Jas 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-hos-14-9","title":"Hosea 14:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HOS","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>wise. Ps 107:43; Pr 1:5,6; 4:18; Jer 9:12; Da 12:10; Mt 13:11,12; Joh 8:47 Joh 18:37 for. Ge 18:25; De 32:4; Job 34:10-12,18,19; Ps 19:7,8; 119:75,128 Eze 18:25; 33:17-20; Zep 3:5; Ro 7:12 and the. Job 17:9; Ps 84:5,7; Pr 10:29; Isa 8:13-15; Mt 11:19 but. Lu 2:34; 4:28,29; 7:23; Joh 3:19,20; 9:39; 15:24; Ro 9:32,33 2Co 2:15,16; 2Th 2:9-12; 1Pe 2:7,8</p>"}]}